WEBVTT


00:00:53.746 --> 00:00:56.579
Shit. There's an immobilizer.


00:00:57.106 --> 00:00:58.459
Someone doesn't want us to leave.


00:00:58.546 --> 00:00:59.865
Oh, man.


00:00:59.986 --> 00:01:02.216
l've got a bad feeling about this.


00:01:03.506 --> 00:01:05.178
You're not going
to believe this shit.


00:01:05.546 --> 00:01:08.265
- They've got one in my truck too.
- Well, now what?


00:01:09.546 --> 00:01:13.505
What now is,
we wait for bravo unit,


00:01:14.906 --> 00:01:16.703
then we all walk out
of here together.


00:01:31.586 --> 00:01:33.781
Victor! Victor! Victor!


00:01:50.066 --> 00:01:51.385
lt's not gonna work.


00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:56.416
Don't sweat it.
Stay sharp, fellas.


00:02:01.386 --> 00:02:02.785
Contact, ten o'clock!


00:02:03.066 --> 00:02:04.419
Victor! Victor! Victor!


00:02:04.546 --> 00:02:06.264
Hold your fire!


00:02:08.466 --> 00:02:11.344
Calm down. What's going on
out there? What's the damage?


00:02:11.426 --> 00:02:13.860
We got hit hard.
There are no other survivors.


00:02:15.186 --> 00:02:16.460
Okay. Continue on to base,


00:02:16.546 --> 00:02:18.184
find Chernov
and tell her what's happened.


00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:19.574
Get back-up. Got it?


00:02:19.946 --> 00:02:21.425
- We got slaughtered.
- Got it!?


00:02:21.786 --> 00:02:23.538
- Yes, sir.
- Get moving!


00:02:27.546 --> 00:02:30.743
Hit the lights!
Position around the humvee.


00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:54.825
Fire!


00:03:05.146 --> 00:03:07.580
Cease fire! Cease fire!


00:03:40.826 --> 00:03:44.136
ls that it!
ls that all you've got!?


00:04:43.066 --> 00:04:44.385
Chernov!


00:04:45.426 --> 00:04:47.621
Chernov! We need help!


00:04:48.346 --> 00:04:49.574
Chernov!


00:05:04.866 --> 00:05:06.743
That was the last one, Dr. Krieger.


00:05:07.826 --> 00:05:09.418
Outstanding.


00:05:09.986 --> 00:05:12.659
Absolutely outstanding.


00:05:49.506 --> 00:05:51.417
Where are the whales, Jack?


00:05:51.746 --> 00:05:54.180
This is a whale
watching tour, right?


00:05:54.266 --> 00:05:56.257
Well that's funny,
because we scheduled them


00:05:56.346 --> 00:05:59.497
to breach over our
boat exactly at 2:45 and. . .


00:05:59.626 --> 00:06:02.584
You promised me whales,
George.


00:06:03.626 --> 00:06:05.901
You hear that?
You go get us some whales


00:06:05.986 --> 00:06:07.465
or you get us our money back.


00:06:07.706 --> 00:06:10.459
l told you, we don't guarantee
you see any whales.


00:06:10.586 --> 00:06:11.860
You get your three hours out


00:06:11.946 --> 00:06:13.777
like everyone else
and take your chances.


00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:15.783
Oh, we're staying out here until
we see some whales.


00:06:15.866 --> 00:06:17.185
You might be,


00:06:17.306 --> 00:06:18.978
but this boat's going
to be back in the harbor...


00:06:19.066 --> 00:06:20.658
at the three hour mark exactly.


00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:24.182
What's that accent?
You're German, right?


00:06:24.426 --> 00:06:28.305
Well let me tell you something
about American customer service.


00:06:28.986 --> 00:06:30.385
We're staying out.


00:06:32.346 --> 00:06:33.779
Okay.


00:06:34.186 --> 00:06:35.778
Can you come over here?


00:06:38.186 --> 00:06:40.063
Can you hold on to this for a sec?


00:06:44.146 --> 00:06:45.499
Where are you going?


00:06:46.986 --> 00:06:48.465
Anybody want some beer?


00:06:53.866 --> 00:06:56.539
George,
what are you doing driving?


00:06:56.746 --> 00:06:57.781
What?


00:07:02.706 --> 00:07:06.858
Hey, and watch out for those rocks.
They're pretty sharp and big.


00:07:13.306 --> 00:07:14.785
We're alright, Jack.


00:07:15.426 --> 00:07:16.620
Take us back.


00:07:16.746 --> 00:07:19.306
But, George,
what about the whales?


00:07:19.426 --> 00:07:21.257
You wanna see a damn whale,
you drive the boat


00:07:22.826 --> 00:07:25.420
- George.
- This was your idea.


00:07:25.546 --> 00:07:29.858
This was not my idea.
You blame everything on me.


00:07:29.946 --> 00:07:31.618
You're the one who bought all
that picture-book stuff


00:07:31.746 --> 00:07:34.340
with whales on it for Christmas.
You gave it to me,


00:07:34.426 --> 00:07:35.541
but you wanted it for yourself...


00:07:35.626 --> 00:07:37.344
You blame everything on me.


00:07:37.426 --> 00:07:38.654
- You couldn't stop...
- You're the one who made us...


00:07:38.786 --> 00:07:40.936
- talking about the whales.
- sign up for Greenpeace.


00:07:57.426 --> 00:07:58.825
Chernov.


00:08:00.426 --> 00:08:03.736
- Good work last night, Katia.
- Thank you, doctor.


00:08:04.226 --> 00:08:05.818
And they were some
of your best men.


00:08:06.346 --> 00:08:07.620
The best money can buy.


00:08:09.586 --> 00:08:11.099
Doctor,


00:08:11.186 --> 00:08:12.665
why wasn't l informed about
the maneuvers...


00:08:12.786 --> 00:08:14.060
outside the perimeter?


00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:16.463
Because it was part of research.


00:08:16.586 --> 00:08:19.578
Anything that takes place
outside on this island


00:08:19.706 --> 00:08:21.822
is a security matter
that concerns me.


00:08:22.106 --> 00:08:24.062
Captain,
l didn't want to trouble you.


00:08:24.626 --> 00:08:27.777
l knew how you
would feel about testing.


00:08:28.426 --> 00:08:29.825
Testing?


00:08:30.106 --> 00:08:33.303
Yes.
Our subject engaged live targets.


00:08:35.986 --> 00:08:37.704
You mean you tested him
on my men.


00:08:38.026 --> 00:08:41.496
One unarmed,
genetically modified soldier


00:08:41.706 --> 00:08:44.345
eliminated ten
heavy-armed men.


00:08:47.426 --> 00:08:48.905
This is, um. . .


00:08:49.226 --> 00:08:52.298
This is way beyond anything
the command would authorize.


00:08:52.426 --> 00:08:55.657
Captain,
they're not even your men.


00:08:57.106 --> 00:08:58.778
They're Chernov's people.


00:08:59.826 --> 00:09:02.465
All of those genetically
modified soldiers,


00:09:02.586 --> 00:09:04.702
or whatever you want
to call those creatures,


00:09:05.586 --> 00:09:07.577
were all once human.


00:09:07.866 --> 00:09:09.857
Yes, that's right.


00:09:11.266 --> 00:09:13.860
Now, if you would excuse me,


00:09:14.146 --> 00:09:16.102
l have to finish my painting.


00:09:27.986 --> 00:09:30.784
Chernov,
is he back in his holding pen?


00:09:31.146 --> 00:09:33.580
Yes. The time-released tranquilizer
worked perfectly.


00:09:33.666 --> 00:09:37.545
Good. You know, if Parker wants
to get that much involved,


00:09:37.906 --> 00:09:42.104
why don't you have him and
his men clean up all the mess?


00:09:45.786 --> 00:09:48.300
l'm not sure how much more
of this l can stomach.


00:09:48.866 --> 00:09:51.096
You mean having that hard bitch
as your boss?


00:09:52.106 --> 00:09:53.664
You know well enough
what l mean.


00:09:54.146 --> 00:09:55.738
Yeah, well l have my orders,


00:09:56.106 --> 00:09:57.619
but you have a choice, Max.


00:09:58.186 --> 00:09:59.744
Why don't you just leave?


00:09:59.826 --> 00:10:03.262
l keep thinking l can do more
good by staying. We'll see.


00:10:06.386 --> 00:10:08.502
Not much of a killer instinct
for a soldier.


00:10:08.706 --> 00:10:11.140
Yeah, well maybe he'll send you
out there next time.


00:10:15.386 --> 00:10:17.456
Don't you think
it's a little farfetched


00:10:17.586 --> 00:10:20.862
- genetically modified soldiers?
- l've got it from a good source.


00:10:23.186 --> 00:10:24.539
Nice.


00:10:25.146 --> 00:10:27.706
You know, it looks like something
from your sasquatch file.


00:10:27.826 --> 00:10:29.054
Very funny.


00:10:29.186 --> 00:10:32.337
lt's a surveillance photo taken
outside Krieger's research facility.


00:10:32.906 --> 00:10:34.737
l don't need to tell you
how much trouble you can...


00:10:34.826 --> 00:10:37.386
get into snooping around
military affairs, do l?


00:10:37.586 --> 00:10:39.895
That's just the thing. All my
usual sources say there's no...


00:10:42.626 --> 00:10:44.298
This is from another source.


00:10:45.746 --> 00:10:47.657
Gorgeous shot of a lumber mill.


00:10:48.266 --> 00:10:49.540
Who are these guys?


00:10:51.186 --> 00:10:52.141
Okay,


00:10:52.506 --> 00:10:54.576
so maybe it's super covert.


00:10:54.826 --> 00:10:57.294
That's all the more reason not
to go snooping around.


00:10:57.426 --> 00:10:59.064
Paul, Krieger has been known


00:10:59.146 --> 00:11:00.784
to perform genetic experiments
on humans.


00:11:00.986 --> 00:11:03.454
Now he resurfaces on an island
secured by soldiers.


00:11:03.906 --> 00:11:06.545
Valerie, l trust your intuition,


00:11:06.626 --> 00:11:08.378
but l am not going to have you
follow up on this lead.


00:11:08.506 --> 00:11:09.734
Do you understand?


00:11:10.826 --> 00:11:12.737
Fine, l'll do it on my own time.


00:11:12.826 --> 00:11:15.659
What time? You work
fourteen hours a day on this paper.


00:11:15.826 --> 00:11:17.259
l'll take some vacation then


00:11:17.906 --> 00:11:19.817
You? Vacation?


00:11:19.906 --> 00:11:21.703
l must have a few
weeks banked, right?


00:11:22.706 --> 00:11:25.140
Why are you so determined
to follow this lead?


00:11:25.226 --> 00:11:27.217
Because it's too good
of a story to pass up.


00:11:28.066 --> 00:11:29.135
Paul.


00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:31.097
Besides,
l've got a personal interest.


00:11:51.746 --> 00:11:53.065
General.


00:11:54.426 --> 00:11:55.984
- General.
- Doctor.


00:11:56.066 --> 00:11:58.102
l'm assuming you've got
something interesting to show me.


00:11:58.266 --> 00:12:00.655
See for yourself. Parker.


00:12:10.186 --> 00:12:11.744
Please.


00:12:25.586 --> 00:12:26.860
Please.


00:12:33.106 --> 00:12:36.701
As you can see, General,
your money was put to good use.


00:12:36.786 --> 00:12:39.619
Doctor, l couldn't care
about fancy facilities.


00:12:39.786 --> 00:12:42.141
What l care about is your results.


00:12:43.866 --> 00:12:46.699
l'm positive
that you'll be satisfied.


00:12:46.826 --> 00:12:48.179
We'll see about that.


00:12:49.906 --> 00:12:51.544
See for yourself.


00:12:57.266 --> 00:12:58.745
He looks fit.


00:13:00.706 --> 00:13:04.221
We have ten holding cells.


00:13:05.906 --> 00:13:09.216
And now l have to show you
something really incredible.


00:13:12.826 --> 00:13:16.421
Here's one we took the liberty
of field testing ourselves.


00:13:21.386 --> 00:13:22.705
Chernov,


00:13:22.826 --> 00:13:24.418
the gun.


00:13:27.386 --> 00:13:29.854
- Shoot him.
- Shoot him?


00:13:29.986 --> 00:13:32.341
Yes, but be careful.
Not in the eyes...


00:13:32.426 --> 00:13:33.859
and not in the mouth.


00:13:48.506 --> 00:13:51.145
- Subcutaneous armor?
- The skin itself,


00:13:51.266 --> 00:13:54.338
twenty times more resistant
to puncture than Kevlar.


00:13:54.426 --> 00:13:58.783
His muscles absorb the blows
and protect his organs.


00:13:59.506 --> 00:14:01.815
Let him loose.
Let's see how he moves.


00:14:01.906 --> 00:14:04.579
l cannot do that
without sedating him.


00:14:04.706 --> 00:14:07.379
He would kill everybody
in this room including me.


00:14:09.186 --> 00:14:11.575
l can control him,
but l have to work on his?


00:14:11.706 --> 00:14:14.220
What good is that,
a weapon that we can't control?


00:14:14.346 --> 00:14:16.814
You can use him under certain
circumstances for...


00:14:16.906 --> 00:14:19.659
That's not what we commissioned
from you, doctor.


00:14:19.746 --> 00:14:22.214
You asked me to create
an invincible soldier.


00:14:22.306 --> 00:14:24.297
That's what l'm presenting
to you today.


00:14:24.426 --> 00:14:25.984
Basically bulletproof,


00:14:26.426 --> 00:14:27.984
no need for sleep,


00:14:28.106 --> 00:14:31.576
and he can fight harder and longer
than any human soldier.


00:14:31.666 --> 00:14:36.581
A soldier? You're making
brainless monsters!


00:14:44.866 --> 00:14:46.458
Sedate him!


00:14:47.466 --> 00:14:48.740
More!


00:14:54.626 --> 00:14:58.175
lf he can't take orders then he's
no better than a vicious animal.


00:14:58.706 --> 00:15:00.139
But some more time


00:15:00.266 --> 00:15:02.336
- and some more money.
- No more funding...


00:15:02.426 --> 00:15:04.462
until you produce something
that we can use.


00:15:23.346 --> 00:15:24.699
Chernov.


00:15:25.026 --> 00:15:26.425
Working late, Max?


00:15:35.426 --> 00:15:36.779
Hey, Uncle Max, it's me.


00:15:36.906 --> 00:15:38.385
l thought l'd leave you
a voice mail


00:15:38.466 --> 00:15:40.422
just in case you were
picking up your messages.


00:15:40.506 --> 00:15:42.656
l responded to your last email,
but l never heard anything back.


00:15:42.786 --> 00:15:44.014
l just wanted to check...


00:15:44.146 --> 00:15:47.343
if we were still meeting
at that spot that you sent me.


00:15:47.586 --> 00:15:50.305
Anyway, l'm heading up now,
so l'll see you soon.


00:15:57.186 --> 00:15:59.336
Hi, this is...
Valerie Cardinal calling.


00:16:00.426 --> 00:16:02.542
l'm calling to confirm that
you were able to get that...


00:16:02.666 --> 00:16:05.100
boat captain that
l requested...Jack Carver.


00:16:05.626 --> 00:16:07.139
That's right.


00:16:07.426 --> 00:16:08.654
Terrific.


00:16:08.746 --> 00:16:10.384
l'll be up there in a few hours.


00:16:10.506 --> 00:16:12.383
- Thank you.
- See you soon.


00:16:13.226 --> 00:16:14.579
- Ralph,
- What?


00:16:14.666 --> 00:16:17.624
you made sure to tell jack
about the client today, right?


00:16:17.706 --> 00:16:19.697
- He knows.
- He should be on the dock,


00:16:19.786 --> 00:16:21.663
fueling up and preparing by now.


00:16:22.266 --> 00:16:24.826
l thought l saw him going
in to the Golden Spruce last night.


00:16:25.106 --> 00:16:27.142
That wouldn't be too unlike him.


00:16:28.786 --> 00:16:30.344
Well his boat is just sitting
out over there.


00:16:30.426 --> 00:16:32.462
Do you see him on deck?


00:16:34.346 --> 00:16:35.335
No, pet, l don't.


00:16:35.426 --> 00:16:37.735
Which means he's probably
sleeping it off.


00:16:37.826 --> 00:16:38.895
He could be.


00:16:39.226 --> 00:16:40.739
Well, aren't you going
to go get him up?


00:16:40.826 --> 00:16:42.100
Hey, look, he'll be here.


00:16:42.226 --> 00:16:44.296
l'm not going to have a captain
represent us,


00:16:44.386 --> 00:16:46.946
showing up unshaven
and hung over for a client!


00:16:47.026 --> 00:16:48.175
Get him up!


00:16:48.306 --> 00:16:49.739
Yes, Pet.


00:16:55.906 --> 00:16:58.704
Medusa, Medusa,
this is Day Beacon, over.


00:17:01.786 --> 00:17:05.461
Medusa, Medusa, wakey-wakey.
This is Day Beacon, over.


00:17:07.626 --> 00:17:09.218
Shit.


00:18:02.786 --> 00:18:04.265
Turn his head.


00:18:07.426 --> 00:18:09.144
Slowly, slowly.


00:18:13.586 --> 00:18:15.258
Max,


00:18:16.386 --> 00:18:18.377
can you hear me?


00:18:22.666 --> 00:18:24.816
- Camera's working.
- Yes, sir, it is.


00:18:25.426 --> 00:18:26.654
Max,


00:18:27.146 --> 00:18:29.580
can you hear me?


00:18:32.146 --> 00:18:33.579
Light.


00:18:37.706 --> 00:18:39.298
Max,


00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:42.504
what color?


00:18:43.426 --> 00:18:45.144
Red.


00:18:45.386 --> 00:18:46.865
Perfect.


00:18:49.866 --> 00:18:51.584
And now?


00:18:53.186 --> 00:18:55.825
- Green.
- Perfect. Perfect.


00:18:56.106 --> 00:18:57.664
Take the light.


00:18:58.546 --> 00:19:01.697
Max. Max, l think
you're going to earn us...


00:19:01.826 --> 00:19:03.737
the rest of our funding.


00:19:05.706 --> 00:19:07.185
Good, good, good, good.


00:19:07.466 --> 00:19:09.536
- Stitch him up.
- Yes, doctor.


00:19:16.626 --> 00:19:18.378
She'll be here soon.


00:19:19.306 --> 00:19:21.820
Maybe you should take
the skiff out and check in on him.


00:19:22.626 --> 00:19:25.379
You know he doesn't like
people dropping in on him.


00:19:25.506 --> 00:19:27.462
Ralph, you're his boss.


00:19:27.586 --> 00:19:29.622
Well, technically,
he's a contractor.


00:19:29.946 --> 00:19:31.937
What? Are you scared of him?


00:19:32.066 --> 00:19:35.581
Pet, you've heard all the stories.


00:19:35.706 --> 00:19:37.901
That's all they are, stories.


00:19:37.986 --> 00:19:40.216
Special army my ass.
He's a drunk.


00:19:40.306 --> 00:19:42.376
Just because he drinks
doesn't mean he's a drunk.


00:19:42.666 --> 00:19:44.816
lt's special forces, pet,
not special army.


00:19:44.946 --> 00:19:46.220
Whatever.


00:19:47.466 --> 00:19:51.061
lf you're not going to do anything,
l will. l'm gonna go get my gun.


00:19:53.786 --> 00:19:55.344
Menopause.


00:20:30.026 --> 00:20:31.379
Reload.


00:20:31.826 --> 00:20:34.215
l don't think you should be
playing with him like this Pat.


00:20:34.346 --> 00:20:36.382
Well, if he's as tough
as you all think...


00:20:36.466 --> 00:20:38.422
he is he should be able to handle
a little shooting.


00:20:38.506 --> 00:20:40.224
Someone could get hurt.


00:20:40.346 --> 00:20:44.498
l mean you could take out
an eye or something.


00:20:52.026 --> 00:20:54.381
Special army my ass.


00:20:54.626 --> 00:20:58.301
Hi. ls this...
Day Beacon Boat Charters?


00:20:58.426 --> 00:21:02.260
- Yes it is and you must be Valerie.
- Hi.


00:21:02.506 --> 00:21:05.179
Hi. l hope l won't be needing one
of those where l'm going.


00:21:06.146 --> 00:21:09.138
Hey, we've got some
paperwork to do. Come on in.


00:21:52.746 --> 00:21:54.065
Keep flipping those, will ya?


00:21:54.546 --> 00:21:58.141
l didn't realize the tour
came with a meal.


00:21:59.346 --> 00:22:00.825
We head straight
back after lunch.


00:22:01.506 --> 00:22:03.258
How much to charter
your boat for the night?


00:22:03.386 --> 00:22:06.378
For the night?
We are not that kind of operation.


00:22:06.466 --> 00:22:08.457
You chartered me for six hours,
okay?


00:22:09.266 --> 00:22:10.619
Jack, did you serve in Germany


00:22:10.746 --> 00:22:12.816
with a man by the name
of Max Cardinal?


00:22:16.146 --> 00:22:19.343
- Who said l was in the services?
- Max is my uncle.


00:22:20.826 --> 00:22:23.545
Very sorry, but l don't know
anybody by that name.


00:22:24.146 --> 00:22:26.785
He said he was really glad to run
into you after he came out here.


00:22:26.906 --> 00:22:31.138
Did he? l really don't know
the guy you're talking about.


00:22:31.746 --> 00:22:33.338
Tischtennis.


00:22:34.306 --> 00:22:35.625
What?


00:22:35.746 --> 00:22:38.055
Tischtennis.
That was your safe word.


00:22:39.706 --> 00:22:41.264
So you're his niece, huh?


00:22:41.826 --> 00:22:43.862
That would make you
the hotshot reporter.


00:22:44.426 --> 00:22:46.382
l prefer journalist.


00:22:46.506 --> 00:22:49.145
Right.
What brings you out here?


00:22:49.226 --> 00:22:50.659
l'm meeting with Max.


00:22:51.906 --> 00:22:53.862
- Where, on that island?
- Yeah.


00:22:54.226 --> 00:22:56.376
That island's off limits
to the public.


00:22:56.466 --> 00:22:59.060
Everyone around here knows
to stay well away from it.


00:22:59.186 --> 00:23:00.301
They're expecting me.


00:23:00.426 --> 00:23:02.735
Right. That's why you
chartered your own boat


00:23:02.866 --> 00:23:04.504
for a little night landing, huh?


00:23:04.626 --> 00:23:06.457
lt's a personal visit.


00:23:09.626 --> 00:23:12.186
- Are you going to take me or not?
- No l won't.


00:23:12.466 --> 00:23:14.218
Max would understand why.


00:23:14.346 --> 00:23:15.904
Did Max tell you what
they're doing over there?


00:23:16.026 --> 00:23:18.460
- No.
- You're not curious?


00:23:18.746 --> 00:23:21.260
l'm curious how that fish
is going to turn out.


00:23:21.506 --> 00:23:23.656
lt's almost done.


00:23:25.546 --> 00:23:27.218
l think Max might be in trouble.


00:23:27.346 --> 00:23:30.144
That man is perfectly capable
of taking care of himself.


00:23:30.306 --> 00:23:31.739
He set up this meeting.


00:23:31.826 --> 00:23:34.386
He sent me a message and
l haven't heard from him since.


00:23:35.706 --> 00:23:36.980
He found out that his client...


00:23:37.106 --> 00:23:38.824
was doing something
that he didn't like.


00:23:39.386 --> 00:23:41.502
Your uncle doesn't like things,
he'd quit.


00:23:41.586 --> 00:23:43.304
l asked him to stay on.


00:23:44.666 --> 00:23:46.816
You're writing a little story, huh?


00:23:57.706 --> 00:23:59.697
That money will buy you
a ride exactly...


00:23:59.826 --> 00:24:01.623
to the island and back.
That's it.


00:24:03.346 --> 00:24:05.814
So much for camaraderie
between soldiers.


00:24:07.626 --> 00:24:09.344
Hey, your fish is cooked.


00:24:09.826 --> 00:24:11.498
Let's see.


00:24:17.106 --> 00:24:19.097
This is burnt.


00:24:19.466 --> 00:24:22.060
- They're crispy.
- Crispy?


00:25:09.266 --> 00:25:10.585
No sign of anyone.


00:25:10.906 --> 00:25:13.864
Max wanted me to meet him up
on the landing, in the woods.


00:25:14.346 --> 00:25:16.223
Why didn't he want
to meet you up on the pier?


00:25:16.426 --> 00:25:19.179
l don't know. Like l said,


00:25:19.306 --> 00:25:21.262
all l got was the last message.


00:25:23.186 --> 00:25:24.699
Wanna come with me?


00:25:24.826 --> 00:25:28.785
No. l can take you to the shore,
but that's about it.


00:25:29.546 --> 00:25:32.106
- Okay.
- You sure you wanna go?


00:25:32.426 --> 00:25:35.384
Yeah. Max is waiting for me.


00:25:37.066 --> 00:25:38.784
Fine.


00:25:45.466 --> 00:25:48.583
- l can take you back.
- No. Let's go.


00:26:58.266 --> 00:26:59.494
Here, take this.


00:27:00.146 --> 00:27:03.183
- Thank you.
- l'm giving you exactly six hours.


00:27:04.266 --> 00:27:06.097
You better be
here when l get back.


00:27:10.226 --> 00:27:12.376
You better be
here when l get back.


00:27:34.426 --> 00:27:36.178
Max?


00:27:36.626 --> 00:27:38.264
Max?


00:27:40.306 --> 00:27:41.739
Max?


00:27:46.306 --> 00:27:49.582
Miss Cardinal,
welcome to the party.


00:27:49.986 --> 00:27:51.214
Let's go.


00:27:52.106 --> 00:27:54.859
- Get rid of the boat.
- My pleasure.


00:27:55.466 --> 00:27:57.184
You're late.


00:28:51.186 --> 00:28:52.744
Check her body.


00:28:54.786 --> 00:28:57.584
l hope you didn't leave anything
important on that boat.


00:28:58.386 --> 00:29:00.183
You just killed a man.


00:29:00.346 --> 00:29:02.382
l'd be more concerned
about yourself.


00:29:05.266 --> 00:29:07.826
- What have you done with Max?
- You'll see soon enough.


00:29:16.386 --> 00:29:19.742
l don't know why we're bothering.
The guy's dead. Bitch.


00:29:21.426 --> 00:29:23.496
You go that way.
l'll check over here.


00:29:40.266 --> 00:29:42.575
- Chernov.
- Docter l have her.


00:29:42.906 --> 00:29:44.055
Good.


00:29:44.186 --> 00:29:47.303
l'm checking for survivors. l'll be
back with the reporter shortly.


00:30:20.466 --> 00:30:22.058
Russell.


00:30:23.146 --> 00:30:24.374
Russell.


00:30:27.986 --> 00:30:29.578
Where are those guys?


00:30:48.986 --> 00:30:50.658
Check the wood line, nine o'clock.


00:30:50.746 --> 00:30:53.818
- Yes sir. Go.
- Move! Move! / clear.


00:31:02.746 --> 00:31:04.657
We've lost contact
with Russell and Kyle.


00:31:04.746 --> 00:31:08.102
- Send a backup team.
- 10-4. Backup team on the way.


00:31:34.346 --> 00:31:36.143
Go after them!


00:31:36.746 --> 00:31:40.056
- Go! Go!
- Go!


00:31:43.866 --> 00:31:46.221
Go! Go! Go! Here we up.


00:31:46.386 --> 00:31:48.980
- l'm handcuffed.
- Wait a second.


00:31:50.186 --> 00:31:52.746
- Universal handcuff key.
- Where'd you get that?


00:31:53.066 --> 00:31:55.580
Never leave home without one.
Turn around.


00:31:59.826 --> 00:32:02.499
- Uh-oh. Here they come.
- Stop them.


00:32:07.146 --> 00:32:09.057
- Here, do it yourself.
- Great. Thanks.


00:32:09.186 --> 00:32:10.380
Are you okay?


00:32:14.426 --> 00:32:16.462
- Okay.
- l'm great.


00:32:31.826 --> 00:32:33.384
Come on.


00:32:41.186 --> 00:32:42.619
Let's go.


00:32:58.786 --> 00:33:00.139
Got it!


00:33:13.666 --> 00:33:15.224
Holy shit!


00:33:16.186 --> 00:33:18.416
- How about pitching in a little?
- l'm trying.


00:33:18.746 --> 00:33:20.657
Try harder, please.


00:33:42.666 --> 00:33:43.860
More help?


00:33:47.946 --> 00:33:49.743
- What are these?
- Well that's sweet.


00:33:50.066 --> 00:33:52.216
lt's called a hand grenade.
Try throwing one.


00:33:57.706 --> 00:33:59.583
- lt didn't work.
- Did you pull the pin?


00:34:00.066 --> 00:34:01.784
They're useless with the pin.


00:34:05.426 --> 00:34:06.859
Hurry up!


00:34:10.826 --> 00:34:13.386
- Did you throw it?
- Uh, yeah.


00:34:24.426 --> 00:34:26.257
Wooo! Yeah.


00:34:32.386 --> 00:34:34.502
- What's happening?
- Oh no.


00:34:36.426 --> 00:34:38.257
Please tell me you have something
else back there.


00:34:38.346 --> 00:34:39.495
l'm trying.


00:34:40.146 --> 00:34:42.455
Hey, what's this thing?


00:34:52.026 --> 00:34:54.665
- What the hell was that?
- l don't know.


00:34:54.786 --> 00:34:56.265
What do you mean
you don't know?


00:34:57.426 --> 00:34:58.575
Look out!


00:35:07.666 --> 00:35:09.384
You've gotta be kidding me.


00:35:25.146 --> 00:35:27.137
Come on. Come on.


00:36:04.746 --> 00:36:07.419
Start the search.
l want confirmation they're dead.


00:36:57.266 --> 00:36:59.336
Let's go inside.


00:37:11.186 --> 00:37:12.778
Are you hurt?


00:37:31.586 --> 00:37:32.735
You've been shot.


00:37:34.106 --> 00:37:35.698
That's just a scratch.


00:37:43.026 --> 00:37:45.779
You better get out
of those wet clothes.


00:37:47.306 --> 00:37:48.785
Okay.


00:37:49.706 --> 00:37:51.378
Turn around.


00:38:32.386 --> 00:38:35.298
Okay,
you can turn around now.


00:38:36.186 --> 00:38:37.380
Thanks.


00:38:38.746 --> 00:38:40.816
l told you Max is in trouble.


00:38:41.946 --> 00:38:43.504
lt's my fault he stayed though.


00:38:44.226 --> 00:38:46.501
l convinced him l could take
the story public.


00:38:46.626 --> 00:38:48.378
lt was his decision to stay.


00:38:52.506 --> 00:38:53.734
What do we do now?


00:38:54.266 --> 00:38:57.064
That's easy.
Get off this island.


00:38:57.546 --> 00:38:59.821
l told you, l'm not leaving
without finding Max.


00:39:01.466 --> 00:39:04.617
You can get us into the mill
to look for him


00:39:04.746 --> 00:39:07.738
No. You hired me
as a water captain.


00:39:07.826 --> 00:39:10.215
Shore excursions aren't
part of the deal.


00:39:10.786 --> 00:39:12.742
Don't you ever think
about anybody...


00:39:12.826 --> 00:39:14.578
except yourself and money.


00:39:16.226 --> 00:39:17.784
Did l mention you owe me a boat.


00:39:24.706 --> 00:39:26.424
Oh, it's cold.


00:39:29.746 --> 00:39:31.623
l think l'm getting hypothermia.


00:39:35.426 --> 00:39:37.064
Can l come in?


00:39:39.666 --> 00:39:41.145
Okay.


00:39:41.266 --> 00:39:46.420
Good. l have to take off
my wet pants, you know.


00:39:47.186 --> 00:39:48.665
Turn around.


00:40:17.906 --> 00:40:20.340
This bed's very uncomfortable,


00:40:20.466 --> 00:40:23.742
- itchy.
- Sorry, the Hyatt was booked out.


00:40:28.826 --> 00:40:31.579
- lt's cold.
- Yeah.


00:40:39.306 --> 00:40:41.536
You know what we used
to do in the military?


00:40:42.666 --> 00:40:44.702
No. What?


00:40:46.346 --> 00:40:51.056
lt was called shared body heat.


00:40:54.226 --> 00:40:55.545
like spooning?


00:40:57.066 --> 00:41:00.695
- You could say so.
- Okay.


00:41:13.706 --> 00:41:16.061
Much better.


00:41:20.146 --> 00:41:21.465
ls that your gun.


00:41:24.386 --> 00:41:28.538
Well l never
go to bed without it.


00:41:29.426 --> 00:41:30.779
Gone.


00:41:52.626 --> 00:41:54.184
So, how was l?


00:41:56.226 --> 00:41:57.500
Where are we headed?


00:41:58.826 --> 00:42:01.021
There's a dock by the mill
on the other side of the island.


00:42:01.146 --> 00:42:02.295
We're going to grab a boat there.


00:42:02.426 --> 00:42:04.098
l told you,
l'm not leaving without Max.


00:42:04.186 --> 00:42:05.665
Don't start again.


00:42:05.786 --> 00:42:07.936
We're going to get a boat
and leave this island.


00:42:12.146 --> 00:42:13.579
You didn't answer my question.


00:42:14.306 --> 00:42:15.421
What do you mean?


00:42:15.746 --> 00:42:16.861
What do l mean?


00:42:17.506 --> 00:42:19.974
On a scale from one to ten,
how would you rate me?


00:42:24.266 --> 00:42:25.221
Two.


00:42:25.586 --> 00:42:27.861
Two? A two?


00:42:28.186 --> 00:42:29.380
What?


00:42:36.146 --> 00:42:37.579
Am l seeing this?


00:42:42.466 --> 00:42:43.865
l'm gonna check it out.


00:42:54.386 --> 00:42:55.614
Get your hands up.


00:43:00.746 --> 00:43:02.145
Get 'em up.


00:43:05.146 --> 00:43:06.625
You're coming back
to base camp.


00:43:16.706 --> 00:43:18.105
Undress.


00:43:29.186 --> 00:43:31.620
l wasn't talking to you.
l was talking to her.


00:43:36.106 --> 00:43:38.666
You wish, huh? l was kidding.


00:43:40.746 --> 00:43:42.065
Keep going.


00:43:43.666 --> 00:43:45.418
l was really only a two.


00:43:47.146 --> 00:43:48.784
Okay, a three.


00:43:54.106 --> 00:43:55.539
Hat.


00:44:17.746 --> 00:44:19.577
Yes sir.


00:44:21.666 --> 00:44:23.384
Parker,
we need two of your trucks.


00:44:23.626 --> 00:44:26.618
Yeah? Well l heard
what happened last night.


00:44:26.946 --> 00:44:29.255
Why don't you leave
island security to us


00:44:29.346 --> 00:44:31.462
and you just stick
to what you're good at,


00:44:31.786 --> 00:44:34.584
- whatever that is.
- Just give me those trucks.


00:44:35.666 --> 00:44:37.861
- l need a word with you.
- Oh.


00:44:38.186 --> 00:44:40.541
Being cannon fodder for mutants
was never part of the deal


00:44:40.666 --> 00:44:42.338
and there have been
a lot of us dying lately.


00:44:42.826 --> 00:44:44.544
We compensate you well enough,


00:44:44.866 --> 00:44:46.777
so you'll whatever
we tell you to do.


00:44:46.906 --> 00:44:50.342
And if we're dead,
you won't have to pay us at all.


00:44:50.706 --> 00:44:51.980
You don't like it you can leave.


00:44:52.106 --> 00:44:54.301
Yeah? Well l'll take
what l know with me.


00:44:58.426 --> 00:45:00.382
You'll be sorry for this.


00:45:08.826 --> 00:45:10.418
Anymore complaints?


00:46:21.866 --> 00:46:23.379
Come on. lt's clear.


00:46:27.626 --> 00:46:29.742
- Oww.
- You're my prisoner.


00:46:54.386 --> 00:46:56.263
Okay. lnside.


00:46:59.546 --> 00:47:01.423
You wait here
and l'll get us a boat.


00:47:01.546 --> 00:47:02.820
l told you, l'm not going.


00:47:03.106 --> 00:47:05.574
Your ride is leaving now, whether
you're on it or not.


00:47:05.906 --> 00:47:07.134
l mean it.


00:47:07.306 --> 00:47:08.534
Not without Max.


00:47:10.146 --> 00:47:11.499
l'm going to bring the boat here


00:47:11.586 --> 00:47:13.258
and you better be
here when l'm back.


00:47:15.466 --> 00:47:17.502
You better be
here when l'm back.


00:47:39.746 --> 00:47:41.099
Dr. Krieger,


00:47:41.186 --> 00:47:42.460
you might want to see this.


00:47:45.786 --> 00:47:47.185
Look at this.


00:47:51.626 --> 00:47:53.105
ls that her?


00:47:53.506 --> 00:47:54.780
Yes.


00:47:56.546 --> 00:47:58.264
l thought she was dead.


00:47:58.546 --> 00:48:00.776
- She soon will be.
- Chernov,


00:48:01.986 --> 00:48:03.544
l want to speak to her.


00:48:03.906 --> 00:48:05.578
Yes, sir.


00:48:12.026 --> 00:48:13.425
Up.


00:48:34.626 --> 00:48:36.662
Take her to the cell
until the doctor's ready.


00:48:41.866 --> 00:48:44.539
Why couldn't they load
this up on the main dock,


00:48:44.626 --> 00:48:47.584
huh? Tell me that. Then we
could have used the forklift.


00:48:47.906 --> 00:48:51.182
Now we have to hump
all these ourselves.


00:48:51.266 --> 00:48:52.665
This is ridiculous!


00:48:54.866 --> 00:48:56.504
Oh, my back.


00:48:56.826 --> 00:49:00.614
Oh, my back.
l think l compressed a disc.


00:49:01.666 --> 00:49:03.145
Forget this.


00:49:03.946 --> 00:49:05.459
l'm taking a break.


00:49:06.426 --> 00:49:12.103
Oh. Oh.


00:49:13.746 --> 00:49:15.737
l wouldn't be sitting down
if l were you.


00:49:15.826 --> 00:49:17.623
You don't want the commandant
to catch you. Come on.


00:49:17.906 --> 00:49:22.138
What the hell do l care?
Because of that tight-ass?


00:49:22.266 --> 00:49:25.463
- What, am l a soldier?
- No!


00:49:25.786 --> 00:49:28.220
- Whatever, man.
- Whatever, man.


00:49:28.346 --> 00:49:30.223
Oh, shit.


00:49:42.626 --> 00:49:48.496
l've been thinking about
you all day, all day.


00:49:54.146 --> 00:49:55.704
That's good.


00:50:03.666 --> 00:50:05.338
Okay?


00:50:05.706 --> 00:50:08.140
Okay? Okay?


00:50:18.866 --> 00:50:21.585
Oh, my back! Oh, my back! Oh.


00:50:23.066 --> 00:50:24.465
l was a goner.


00:50:24.626 --> 00:50:27.424
Oh my god. You saved my life!
You saved my life!


00:50:27.546 --> 00:50:29.935
- Oh my god. l was...
- lt's okay.


00:50:30.426 --> 00:50:31.302
Who the hell are you anyway?


00:50:31.386 --> 00:50:33.104
What are you doing sneaking up
on me like that?


00:50:33.186 --> 00:50:36.144
Hey! What are you two doing?


00:50:38.626 --> 00:50:39.661
Who are you?


00:50:40.746 --> 00:50:42.862
Answer me.
l said who are you?


00:50:43.266 --> 00:50:47.259
l'm the food guy.
l'm the food guy


00:50:47.546 --> 00:50:50.583
- l came for a friend, one of yours.
- Who?


00:50:50.666 --> 00:50:51.860
Max Cardinal.


00:50:52.146 --> 00:50:54.296
He's a good man, but he's gone.


00:50:54.426 --> 00:50:55.779
What do you mean he's gone?


00:50:56.426 --> 00:50:58.815
He got caught spying
and he's as good as dead.


00:51:00.626 --> 00:51:01.820
Get back.


00:51:03.626 --> 00:51:06.060
Oh, my back. Oh. My back.


00:51:06.786 --> 00:51:08.424
- Get him off the boat.
- Hey,


00:51:08.546 --> 00:51:11.060
there's someone down here!
He's got Parker!


00:51:15.706 --> 00:51:16.775
Oh my god!


00:51:20.426 --> 00:51:23.338
Where are we going?


00:53:15.186 --> 00:53:16.539
Keep going!


00:53:22.506 --> 00:53:24.701
- We got him.
- Oh, no.


00:53:43.586 --> 00:53:45.622
Hold! Stop the boat!


00:53:55.546 --> 00:53:58.618
- What's your name?
- Jack.


00:53:59.026 --> 00:54:00.505
l'm Emilio.


00:54:01.506 --> 00:54:02.700
Nice to meet you.


00:54:03.426 --> 00:54:05.496
You owe me a meatball sandwich.


00:54:16.546 --> 00:54:18.616
So, you are the cause
of our recent troubles.


00:54:18.946 --> 00:54:21.619
Tell you what. Replace my boat
and we'll call it even.


00:54:21.946 --> 00:54:23.140
Who sent you?


00:54:24.106 --> 00:54:25.505
l'm just a driver.


00:54:25.626 --> 00:54:28.504
l see.
You're just a simple boatman.


00:54:28.786 --> 00:54:30.219
ls that your story?


00:54:30.386 --> 00:54:32.536
l haven't said anything
about being simple.


00:54:32.626 --> 00:54:33.695
Whatever.


00:54:34.026 --> 00:54:35.095
We have your colleague


00:54:35.186 --> 00:54:37.302
and l'm sure
she will have much more to say.


00:54:37.666 --> 00:54:40.339
That's great. So you won't
be needing me then.


00:54:40.466 --> 00:54:42.377
That's correct. l don't need you,


00:54:42.706 --> 00:54:45.584
but as you're here
l may as well use you


00:54:45.906 --> 00:54:48.181
to be part of my new experiment.


00:54:48.306 --> 00:54:49.534
See you then.


00:54:56.826 --> 00:54:59.215
Well l think that went quite well,
don't you?


00:54:59.346 --> 00:55:01.223
He wasn't looking at me,
was he?


00:55:01.546 --> 00:55:03.502
He was just talking
about you, right?


00:55:11.546 --> 00:55:14.379
You mind if we sit?


00:55:14.746 --> 00:55:17.101
l have a feeling this
is going to take a while.


00:55:17.186 --> 00:55:18.380
Sure.


00:55:18.746 --> 00:55:21.465
On three. l used to do this
in dance camp.


00:55:21.626 --> 00:55:24.379
One, two, three.


00:55:28.026 --> 00:55:30.665
Except we weren't cuffed
in dance camp.


00:55:39.866 --> 00:55:41.345
So, uh,...


00:55:43.546 --> 00:55:45.855
you ever have anything
like this ever happen


00:55:45.946 --> 00:55:48.744
to you and you get out
of the situation or


00:55:48.906 --> 00:55:52.581
anything remotely like this?


00:55:57.546 --> 00:56:01.380
l wanted to die fast, you know,
like by a shark.


00:56:07.946 --> 00:56:09.299
Get up.


00:56:11.186 --> 00:56:12.778
Take her to Dr. Krieger's office.


00:56:38.106 --> 00:56:39.539
Leave us.


00:56:51.106 --> 00:56:53.142
Sorry about the rough treatment,


00:56:56.666 --> 00:57:00.181
but these people only know
one way to deal with intruders.


00:57:02.226 --> 00:57:03.545
Sit down.


00:57:08.626 --> 00:57:10.105
Dr. Krieger,
you should know that


00:57:10.226 --> 00:57:11.579
the newspaper
is aware that l'm here


00:57:11.666 --> 00:57:13.224
and will be alerting
the authorities.


00:57:13.386 --> 00:57:14.865
lt's all been taken care of.


00:57:16.226 --> 00:57:19.616
The coast guard reported
you lost at sea.


00:57:19.826 --> 00:57:21.100
What you don't know
is my bodyguard


00:57:21.186 --> 00:57:22.904
is on his way to the mainland
in a boat.


00:57:23.186 --> 00:57:24.380
Strange.


00:57:24.866 --> 00:57:27.380
He told me that
he was just your driver.


00:57:28.626 --> 00:57:31.220
You know, if he wouldn't
have turned around,


00:57:32.426 --> 00:57:34.303
we would have never caught him.


00:57:34.626 --> 00:57:38.221
Us being without
a helicopter these days.


00:57:39.026 --> 00:57:41.494
You know that you
owe me a helicopter.


00:57:41.626 --> 00:57:42.820
Where's Max?


00:57:43.826 --> 00:57:48.024
Looking at you, you don't look
at all like your Uncle Max.


00:57:48.306 --> 00:57:51.696
l want to see him
or l'm not saying another word.


00:57:52.746 --> 00:57:56.534
You will see him
and you will say another word,


00:57:56.866 --> 00:57:58.538
when the time has come.


00:58:11.826 --> 00:58:13.464
Applying the foundation?


00:58:15.826 --> 00:58:19.739
Sit down.
Go back and sit down.


00:58:30.306 --> 00:58:32.137
You ever play l spy?


00:58:32.626 --> 00:58:36.858
- Nah. You wanna play l spy?
- Yeah, let's play l spy.


00:58:37.506 --> 00:58:40.543
Well, now, we can if you want.


00:58:40.626 --> 00:58:42.139
Let's play l spy.


00:58:42.706 --> 00:58:44.298
Okay. l'll go first.


00:58:44.946 --> 00:58:47.335
- Okay. You got it?
- Yeah.


00:58:47.426 --> 00:58:52.261
Okay. ls it a freaky doctor?


00:58:54.586 --> 00:58:56.144
My creations.


00:58:56.786 --> 00:58:58.697
You are looking at
the deadliest ground troop...


00:58:58.786 --> 00:59:00.105
to ever walk the planet.


00:59:00.226 --> 00:59:01.705
Have a look for yourself.


00:59:09.146 --> 00:59:12.422
You won't find a more technically


00:59:12.546 --> 00:59:14.025
advanced facility anywhere
in the world.


00:59:17.866 --> 00:59:19.504
Max!


00:59:24.226 --> 00:59:27.741
He can't hear you.
He just finished his treatment.


00:59:27.826 --> 00:59:29.942
He's still coming out
of his sedation.


00:59:30.066 --> 00:59:31.135
What have you done to him?


00:59:31.466 --> 00:59:33.821
Made him a better soldier
than he ever was before.


00:59:34.706 --> 00:59:38.415
Max is right. You're a sick,
egotistical maniac.


00:59:38.786 --> 00:59:40.583
Let's not go over the top.


00:59:40.746 --> 00:59:42.384
l'm just greed.


00:59:42.706 --> 00:59:44.059
You can't imagine
how much money...


00:59:44.186 --> 00:59:46.495
the government is paying
for research like that.


00:59:46.626 --> 00:59:48.264
How can you live like that?


00:59:48.346 --> 00:59:51.224
l live fine, thank you.


00:59:51.386 --> 00:59:53.263
Let's continue the tour.


01:00:02.626 --> 01:00:03.854
Jack!


01:00:04.626 --> 01:00:06.298
Are you okay?


01:00:08.986 --> 01:00:11.784
- Make them pay.
- Happy reunions.


01:00:11.866 --> 01:00:14.141
He turned Max into one
of his creatures.


01:00:14.866 --> 01:00:17.141
We like to refer
to them as genetically


01:00:17.306 --> 01:00:18.944
modified soldiers around here.


01:00:19.106 --> 01:00:22.178
Your two friends will be
undergoing the same process.


01:00:22.266 --> 01:00:25.178
Your friend Jack
has real potential.


01:00:25.266 --> 01:00:28.338
Did he say friends? Yeah, hi.
------------------------------


01:00:28.426 --> 01:00:30.178
l don't know these people.


01:00:30.266 --> 01:00:32.302
l've never even seen her before.


01:00:32.626 --> 01:00:34.662
Then why did you try
to help them escape?


01:00:34.786 --> 01:00:36.697
Escape? No, no, no.


01:00:37.026 --> 01:00:38.857
He hijacked the boat,
and then he hijacked me.


01:00:39.146 --> 01:00:41.137
l don't like him.
l don't even know him.


01:00:45.466 --> 01:00:47.377
My process
will be a waste on you.


01:00:47.466 --> 01:00:49.422
Yeah, that's right.
l'm covered in flab.


01:00:49.546 --> 01:00:50.615
What should we do with him, sir?


01:00:51.506 --> 01:00:52.655
May be just kill him.


01:00:52.986 --> 01:00:55.739
No. no. no. no.
You don't want to kill me!


01:00:55.826 --> 01:00:57.544
Come on.
l'll be your personal valet.


01:00:57.626 --> 01:01:01.778
l can help you in many ways.
l'm the food guy! Oh,


01:01:01.906 --> 01:01:05.137
Oh! No! Goddammit.


01:01:05.466 --> 01:01:07.696
Come on! Will you shut up?


01:01:07.826 --> 01:01:11.136
We've gotta escape.
Stop choking, you big baby.


01:01:11.506 --> 01:01:15.579
Come on. Spit it out. Spit it out.


01:01:18.626 --> 01:01:20.537
- Pick it up.
- Pick up what?


01:01:21.266 --> 01:01:23.575
- What does it look like?
- Holy tomato.


01:01:23.666 --> 01:01:24.940
Where'd you get that?


01:01:25.106 --> 01:01:28.143
Come on. Let me get it.
Let me get it. That's pretty good.


01:01:28.586 --> 01:01:30.702
That's very good. Buddy. . .


01:01:30.826 --> 01:01:34.216
l...l got it.


01:01:34.546 --> 01:01:37.618
Okay. Okay. Open the cuffs.


01:01:37.746 --> 01:01:42.137
There it goes.
Now l missed it. You do it.


01:01:43.266 --> 01:01:44.335
Okay up.


01:01:44.426 --> 01:01:45.575
- Up like dance camp.
- One!


01:01:45.666 --> 01:01:47.304
- Up like dance camp.
- Two! Three!


01:01:52.266 --> 01:01:54.780
Okay. You do it. l can't do it.


01:01:54.866 --> 01:01:56.379
You do it. You got it?


01:01:57.426 --> 01:01:58.859
Come on. Just do it.


01:01:59.146 --> 01:02:01.785
- Where is it?
- lt's right there. Got it?


01:02:05.946 --> 01:02:09.222
Okay, good. Nice. Nice.


01:02:09.346 --> 01:02:11.576
- Hey, what about me?
- Come on.


01:02:25.586 --> 01:02:28.498
Let's see if my work
on Max has been successful.


01:02:34.106 --> 01:02:36.176
Release GMS nine.


01:02:36.786 --> 01:02:38.139
Yes, doctor.


01:02:39.426 --> 01:02:41.781
This room is making me
claustrophobic.


01:02:48.066 --> 01:02:51.422
Whatever happens, l got your
back you got mine, okay?


01:02:54.546 --> 01:02:55.820
Max.


01:02:56.546 --> 01:03:00.016
You know this guy?
Man, he looks rough.


01:03:00.186 --> 01:03:02.381
Good thing he doesn't know
you're banging his niece.


01:03:02.466 --> 01:03:05.185
Hey, he used to be a nice guy,
okay?


01:03:08.146 --> 01:03:10.501
- Max?
- l don't know, man.


01:03:10.586 --> 01:03:12.258
He doesn't look so nice.


01:03:12.826 --> 01:03:15.135
lf l've done my job correctly,


01:03:15.266 --> 01:03:18.144
your Uncle Max won't rip
the arms off your friends yet,


01:03:18.786 --> 01:03:20.424
unless l give the command.


01:03:22.226 --> 01:03:25.741
Max, remember me? l'm Jack.


01:03:27.186 --> 01:03:29.541
l'm going to let you two sort
this out, okay?


01:03:37.506 --> 01:03:38.825
Max,


01:03:39.986 --> 01:03:43.103
- execute.
- Max, no! Don't do it.


01:03:43.186 --> 01:03:45.256
Let's not get carried away,
please.


01:03:45.386 --> 01:03:47.616
Max, remember me?
l'm Jack.


01:03:47.746 --> 01:03:50.214
- Remember?
- Max!


01:03:50.666 --> 01:03:53.624
Max! Kill them!


01:03:58.066 --> 01:04:00.375
- Max.
- lt's a dead end.


01:04:01.826 --> 01:04:03.259
Max,


01:04:03.746 --> 01:04:07.819
tischtennis. Remember?
Tischtennis


01:04:19.226 --> 01:04:21.456
There's Valerie, up there.


01:04:21.586 --> 01:04:23.577
Max, kill them!


01:04:43.866 --> 01:04:45.538
Come on. Come on


01:04:47.626 --> 01:04:50.265
- What are you doing?
- He wised up.


01:04:50.386 --> 01:04:52.661
Release GMS 7 and 8.


01:06:49.346 --> 01:06:51.541
Go! Go! Go!...


01:07:14.346 --> 01:07:16.143
Same team. Same team.


01:07:16.706 --> 01:07:19.140
That's it? That's your plan,
stay here and paint?


01:07:47.826 --> 01:07:50.135
- l can't get a clean shot!
- Get him! Take him down!


01:08:10.346 --> 01:08:11.699
Stop.


01:08:25.466 --> 01:08:27.058
We still looking for that broad?


01:08:28.666 --> 01:08:31.100
Holy shit. They must
do a lot of humping here,


01:08:31.226 --> 01:08:32.659
because those things
breed like rabbits.


01:08:38.306 --> 01:08:39.341
Go.


01:08:39.426 --> 01:08:40.859
Where are we going?


01:08:48.146 --> 01:08:49.625
Run, hide.


01:08:49.746 --> 01:08:51.702
l'm just a food guy.


01:10:31.666 --> 01:10:33.418
Asshole.


01:10:36.426 --> 01:10:39.259
Everybody, drop down!
Be aware!


01:10:40.346 --> 01:10:42.416
Remember, eyes and mouth!


01:11:14.226 --> 01:11:17.423
Mr. Masaki, it's Dr. Krieger.


01:11:17.906 --> 01:11:19.180
l'm ready to deliver.


01:11:19.426 --> 01:11:20.779
Are you still interested?


01:11:21.826 --> 01:11:25.102
Good. We agree to the terms?


01:11:26.066 --> 01:11:27.465
Wonderful.


01:11:27.546 --> 01:11:30.299
l'll see you in Shanghai.
What day?


01:11:31.666 --> 01:11:33.497
See you then.


01:11:37.146 --> 01:11:40.138
- What is it?
- Doctor, the perimeter is overrun.


01:11:40.266 --> 01:11:42.382
We are sustaining
heavy casualties.


01:11:42.906 --> 01:11:44.578
l'm going to sound
an evacuation.


01:11:44.706 --> 01:11:47.220
Let's make one thing clear.


01:11:48.026 --> 01:11:50.142
You're holding your position.


01:11:50.226 --> 01:11:53.616
My men are getting slaughtered.
l'm going to order a fallback.


01:11:53.746 --> 01:11:55.384
You're not falling back.


01:11:55.506 --> 01:11:58.304
You are holding your position.
ls that clear?


01:11:58.426 --> 01:12:00.701
Sir, with all due respect. . .


01:12:00.946 --> 01:12:04.780
go shove your civilian orders. . .
up your civilian ass.


01:12:07.706 --> 01:12:09.298
Cover me!


01:12:11.466 --> 01:12:12.660
Chernov.


01:12:13.506 --> 01:12:15.576
- Doctor.
- Some problems.


01:12:16.106 --> 01:12:19.098
- Eliminate Parker.
- Yes, doctor.


01:12:19.706 --> 01:12:20.855
Chernov.


01:12:22.186 --> 01:12:24.780
l need an escort to the pier.


01:12:25.186 --> 01:12:27.381
- Copy that.
- Get back! Come on!


01:12:36.146 --> 01:12:39.138
Sir, Dr. Krieger's personal
boat is readying for launch.


01:12:39.226 --> 01:12:42.741
Of course. The biggest rat
is first off the sinking ship.


01:12:44.106 --> 01:12:46.142
We sure as hell ain't
going to cover his retreat.


01:12:46.466 --> 01:12:49.344
lf we get there first,
we take his boat.


01:12:49.666 --> 01:12:50.860
Get all remaining units...


01:12:51.146 --> 01:12:52.864
to rendezvous
at rally point bravo.


01:12:53.746 --> 01:12:56.340
All units, this is Claw Zero Six.


01:12:56.626 --> 01:13:00.585
All claw units rendezvous at rally
point bravo. Confirm. Over.


01:13:00.666 --> 01:13:02.418
Copy. Rally point bravo.


01:13:02.546 --> 01:13:05.185
Come on. Pull back.
Pull back!


01:13:39.866 --> 01:13:44.223
- We lost him, sir.
- We're going to have to leave him.


01:14:07.986 --> 01:14:11.217
You are one persistent son
of a bitch.


01:14:11.386 --> 01:14:14.378
Yes l am. Let me pass.


01:14:14.466 --> 01:14:18.254
We're leaving.
Why don't you come with us?


01:14:18.426 --> 01:14:20.178
Krieger still has my colleague.


01:14:20.266 --> 01:14:21.779
Well Krieger's about to leave.


01:14:22.586 --> 01:14:24.542
l won't let him leave with her.


01:14:26.106 --> 01:14:27.619
l admire your loyalty.


01:14:28.946 --> 01:14:31.141
lt's something
in short supply around here.


01:14:32.106 --> 01:14:34.222
But once Krieger gets
on that boat,


01:14:34.906 --> 01:14:37.579
he's no longer our concern.


01:14:39.266 --> 01:14:42.781
Okay. l'm going to put
my weapon down.


01:14:51.146 --> 01:14:52.659
How do l find his boat?


01:14:53.026 --> 01:14:54.778
Passageway,
back the way you came.


01:14:55.186 --> 01:14:58.735
Follow it, the stairs down
to the ground floor


01:14:59.066 --> 01:15:01.296
and head straight to the far
end of the building.


01:15:03.866 --> 01:15:05.345
Thanks.


01:15:05.426 --> 01:15:10.136
Wait a second.
Your gun is empty.


01:15:13.866 --> 01:15:15.345
Take that.


01:15:18.066 --> 01:15:19.499
Happy hunting.


01:15:19.866 --> 01:15:22.778
Remember, aim for the eyes
or the mouth.


01:15:23.226 --> 01:15:24.579
Thank you.


01:15:36.426 --> 01:15:37.779
Parker.


01:15:40.426 --> 01:15:42.701
Get everyone back to the boats
and leave immediately.


01:15:43.186 --> 01:15:47.179
- But, sir.
- lt's okay. Now move.


01:15:53.866 --> 01:15:55.538
Where are they going?


01:15:55.626 --> 01:15:57.935
They're withdrawing,
on my orders.


01:16:05.906 --> 01:16:09.262
Traitor. Get out.


01:16:09.386 --> 01:16:11.581
Parker! Parker!


01:16:14.746 --> 01:16:16.498
Oh, shit.


01:16:41.666 --> 01:16:43.224
Bitch.


01:17:24.866 --> 01:17:26.504
Chernov.


01:17:28.586 --> 01:17:30.383
- Chernov.
- Yes, sir.


01:17:30.466 --> 01:17:31.865
What's going on down there?


01:17:32.146 --> 01:17:34.216
- l'm on it.
- l'm waiting.


01:17:34.506 --> 01:17:36.098
Give me two minutes.


01:17:36.426 --> 01:17:38.303
l'm waiting!


01:17:56.186 --> 01:17:58.097
- l'm waiting!
- Good.


01:17:58.706 --> 01:18:00.378
You first.


01:18:10.586 --> 01:18:12.144
Chernov,


01:18:12.866 --> 01:18:14.584
let's go to the boat.


01:18:28.466 --> 01:18:30.661
Tell your men to hold exactly
where they are.


01:18:30.986 --> 01:18:33.341
Don't move.
Stay exactly where you are.


01:18:35.386 --> 01:18:37.104
Let her go.


01:18:39.826 --> 01:18:41.623
Let the girl go.


01:18:42.306 --> 01:18:44.774
Chernov, let the girl go!


01:18:45.306 --> 01:18:47.376
- Gun down.
- Dream on.


01:18:49.346 --> 01:18:50.699
Let her go.


01:18:51.226 --> 01:18:52.579
Gun down.


01:18:59.306 --> 01:19:00.500
Kill him.


01:20:19.826 --> 01:20:21.464
Max!


01:20:23.946 --> 01:20:25.538
Max.


01:20:33.986 --> 01:20:35.260
Let's go.


01:20:53.666 --> 01:20:57.341
Jack! Jack! Jack!


01:20:58.346 --> 01:21:00.496
Come on. Come on. Come on.


01:21:00.826 --> 01:21:02.384
Those freaky things
are following you.


01:21:02.506 --> 01:21:05.304
- Come on. Let's go.
- Can anybody hear me?


01:21:06.026 --> 01:21:07.584
Can anybody hear me?


01:21:09.426 --> 01:21:11.781
Captain, where's the boat?!


01:21:26.866 --> 01:21:28.777
You must be joking.


01:21:33.826 --> 01:21:35.179
Step back!


01:22:11.586 --> 01:22:13.258
As my editor expected, we got...


01:22:13.346 --> 01:22:15.655
a visit from the men
in black suits.


01:22:16.106 --> 01:22:19.143
No story can run that
jeopardizes national security.


01:22:19.266 --> 01:22:20.745
So what are you going to do?


01:22:21.986 --> 01:22:23.260
l'll keep working on it.


01:22:24.066 --> 01:22:27.854
That's good.
So, here she is.


01:22:28.786 --> 01:22:30.139
Where'd you get that?


01:22:30.266 --> 01:22:31.665
lnsurance bought it for me.


01:22:33.146 --> 01:22:35.614
- Wait a minute. ls that Emilio?
- Yeah.


01:22:37.386 --> 01:22:39.695
He's my new deckhand
and my new cook.


01:22:40.586 --> 01:22:42.861
- A pretty decent cook.
- Wow.


01:22:45.026 --> 01:22:47.256
Well, l should probably
get back to work.


01:22:51.586 --> 01:22:53.144
Hey, uh,...


01:22:53.986 --> 01:22:57.262
the day when you rated me two
out of ten you were joking, right?


01:23:02.866 --> 01:23:04.458
Will l see you tomorrow?


01:23:05.106 --> 01:23:06.425
Yes.


01:23:10.706 --> 01:23:13.095
Two points.
She wouldn't see me...


01:23:13.386 --> 01:23:15.342
if l was only two points.


01:23:20.946 --> 01:23:24.495
Jack,
we got our first customers.


01:23:24.906 --> 01:23:26.464
That's great.


01:23:26.906 --> 01:23:28.419
Hey, Jack.


01:23:28.546 --> 01:23:29.774
l think you owe
us some whales, Jack.


01:23:29.906 --> 01:23:31.498
Yeah, we wanna see whales.


01:23:31.906 --> 01:23:33.578
You hear that? The little lady
wants to see some whales.


01:23:33.706 --> 01:23:35.458
They wanna see whales.


01:23:36.706 --> 01:23:38.264
Come on, Jack.
This is boat looks like...


01:23:38.346 --> 01:23:39.745
it's faster than your last one.


01:23:39.826 --> 01:23:41.896
Where...?


01:23:42.026 --> 01:23:43.937
Wait...
Where are you going, Jack?


01:23:44.066 --> 01:23:45.021
Jack?


01:23:45.146 --> 01:23:47.614
- Jack?
- You do it, Emilio.


01:23:47.706 --> 01:23:48.934
- What? l don't know...
- lt's all yours.


01:23:49.026 --> 01:23:50.698
- anything about the whales!
- l don't care.


01:23:50.826 --> 01:23:52.737
He's just having a little hissy-fit.
He'll come right back.


01:23:53.066 --> 01:23:57.378
Just shut up.
You're scaring him. Jack! Jack!


01:23:57.466 --> 01:23:59.502
He's German. He's emotional.

